SUMMARY:Opening Ceremonies
DESCRIPTION:You arrive at the city of Harborfall. &nbsp\;You have left the trappings of your old life behind in order to start a quest... AN ADVENTURE. This... this is where it begins. &nbsp\;Come join the local Wardens who keep the land to guide you through the next few days. Prepare your spell slots\, grab your rations\, and be ready for things to get.... dicey.
