SUMMARY:Make-Your-Own Paper Dice
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever longed to have the coolest dice at the table? &nbsp\;Modular folding: just a little patience\, a little construction and you can build those D4\, D6\, D8s and bigger! &nbsp\;You'll learn to make one unit\, repeat over and over again\, and we'll show you how to build it into a dice to take home. &nbsp\;Basic folding skills suggested.&nbsp\;
